    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on thompson1917-ch05-23: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.61";
    dc:description "The passive-film model makes clear structural and dynamical predictions that can be compared with active alternatives. Open microscopy resolves major parts of the claim, but comprehensive curvature and force measurements across all named groups are unavailable.";
