    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Use ultrastructure and live imaging to test whether the membrane is a fluid film of constant mean curvature lacking active machinery, versus a structurally integrated, actively driven flagellum-attached membrane.";
