    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Constant curvature alone would not uniquely identify a passive liquid film.", "Few datasets combine ultrastructure, curvature, and dynamics.";
